		line=787,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020170"},
		line=787,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"The crisp morning air perfuses my lungs with each breath I take.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Illumined by the diaphanous sunbeams, we face off against each other with our blades aimed for each other's throats.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Teaaaaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Hotori lunges forward with a spirited shout.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"I immediately dodge backwards as quickly as I can.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Yet the tip of her blade still grazes my shirt.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Her skills have improved dramatically since just the other day.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"She's a completely changed woman.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haaaaaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Hotori isn't one to overlook my momentary lapse in concentration.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"The next thing I know, her follow-up strike is already closing in on my neck.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"The wooden blade disappears from my grip before I even have time to draw breath.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"It rolls to a rest behind Hotori with a dry clatter.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You got me.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, your heart's not in it.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If this was a real battle, you'd be long dead.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No kidding.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"I move to pick up my blade with a wry smile.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You've gotten stronger.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“R-Really?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. I hardly recognized you.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Hotori has always been strong, but her one flaw is that her style is too by the numbers.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"It causes her movements to be easy to see through.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"But today, Hotori is boldly putting her own take on the standard fighting forms.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"It feels like she's adapted her bladesmanship with the express intent of defeating me.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I thought I'd mix things up a bit.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“'Cause you know, after that battle in the Imperial Palace, I finally realized what I'm lacking.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Hotori shows me a slightly bashful smile.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Up until now, she firmly believed that the fundamentals were all that mattered, cornering herself by focusing on them to the exclusion of anything else.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"She's changed a lot since then.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I never thought we'd get the chance to train together again like this.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, you can say that again.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"I take the handkerchief Hotori shyly offers me.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You saved me.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No way. You're the one who saved me, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I was only able to fight the way I did because you were right next to me.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you for always being there... for me.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Hotori's upturned eyes stare into my own.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"The corners of her eyes slowly moisten her long eyelashes.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Before I realize it, tears are rolling down the side of my cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"The realization that Soujin is still alive, that I still get to be by his side, hits me all at once, leaving me so deliriously happy that I hardly know what to do with myself. ",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Even after the war ended, Soujin never came home.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Coupled with the annihilation of the Myougi Squad, I found myself in the depths of despair.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"I faintly remember locking myself up in a dark room because I was too scared to look anyone in the face.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"I scarcely remember what happened during those endlessly long days...",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"...Until, one day, I received the news.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin is alive?!”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"I run and run and run─",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"I run like I've never run before.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"By the time I arrive at Koujiya Flowers, my shoes are nowhere to be found.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Until the end of my days, I'll never forget that moment I first heard his voice, saw the look in his eyes.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Who... are you?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"─I'd give anything if it just meant that he'd be alive.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"─I could die happy if I could just hear his voice one last time.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"In that moment, I realize that all these thoughts were nothing more than the self-serving delusions of a self-centered girl.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"As clear as day, I hear a fragile sound of shattering from deep within my chest.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"...Soujin has lost all of his memories.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Yet from that day on, I devoted myself to taking care of Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"I had a monumental task before me, everything from taking care of his basic necessities to imparting upon him all the knowledge needed to survive in this new world.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"At the beginning, the pain of Soujin having forgotten about me was just as raw as that first meeting, but time eventually heals all wounds.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"As he listened to my words, ate my cooking, and crossed blades with me, Soujin gradually reclaimed some semblance of normalcy.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"I was beside myself with joy that the person who had stolen my heart was finally within arm's reach and slowly coming to stand on his own two feet.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"And though I knew just how unfair it was, some small part of me still hoped that maybe, just maybe, Soujin might fall in love with me.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Looking back on it now, the only reason I was able to hold myself together was probably because he was there for me to take care of.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"After bringing the Myougi Squad to ruin, I desperately needed some reason for living to cling on to.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"In all likelihood, I was unwittingly forcing the roles of helpless child, bosom friend, and cherished lover all upon Soujin, who didn't know any better.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"But those sweet, dreamlike days that I wished could go on forever crumbled away with Miyaguni's arrival.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Soujin left the nest I'd built up all this time in order to serve her.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Consumed by jealousy, I went as far as to turn my blade on them.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"And on top of that, Maki lost his faith in me, and I lost yet another important person in my life.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Only after all that did I finally, finally work up the resolve to stand on my own two feet.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"“There are things you must fight to protect.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Pride and duty, the past and the future, others and yourself... There are many things we must fight for.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The only thing easier than hating others is to hate yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Hating and blaming yourself is all too easy.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"It's all too easy to spend all eternity wallowing in your self-made sorrows.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Drowning myself in self-hatred for leading the Myougi Squad to ruin was just an excuse for me to run away from my own responsibilities.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Reluctant to step out from Father's shadow, I refused to call myself anything but acting chairman.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Though I desperately tried to act the part of the chairman of the Sworn Blades, I lacked the fundamental resolve.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"─I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" take responsibility for the Blades.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"That is all I need to know.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, thanks for sticking with me... all this time.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As if I'd ever leave you.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How many times do I have to say it? I'll always stay by your side.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Just those words alone send a sweet tingle spreading across my chest.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"...But I have to make things clear between us.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I think I've been taking advantage of you.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You couldn't leave me because of everything I was doing for you... right?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"I want him to deny it.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"I can't help but cling on to this faint hope in my heart of hearts.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There is that.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“After all you've done for me, there's no way I could abandon you.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"The strength drains from my body at his matter-of-fact declaration.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm? Am I wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No, it's okay... I'll be strong.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"I forgot how dense Soujin can be.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"But that's part of what makes him so lovable.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's right. Be strong and set a good example as the chairman of the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll always be by your side.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why do you have to still say that?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's fine. You've repaid me enough. You can go your own way now.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't just leave you.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why? You don't have to worry about me anymore, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Try as I might, I can't hold back my tears.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Here I've just declared that I'm going to be strong, but I'm still a total mess in front of Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san said that between two warriors, words are entirely unnecessary.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She predicted that our feelings would reach one another as soon as we faced the enemy with our backs to each other.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“By letting our blades convey what mere words cannot.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When we fought together in the Imperial Palace, I felt as though we'd become one. Am I wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Well...”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Just thinking back to that battle makes my heart race.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Soujin cut down anyone who threatened me, and I did the same for him.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"I had Soujin's back, and he had mine.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Ours was a dazzling dance of life and death.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"In the midst of that storm of steel, the boundary between me and Soujin blurred and wavered until we surely fused as one.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"The enemy no longer even registered in my view; all I could see, all I could feel was ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"him.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"─Nothing could possibly stand in our way.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"That conviction permeated my entire body.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Ah, that ecstasy...",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"The next thing I know, I've collapsed to the floor in a quivering heap.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"My heart is beating out of my chest.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"My body is flushed with excitement, and every last pore on my skin is sweating.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"...I know.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"I'm getting excited just thinking back to it...",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You aren't wrong.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You aren't wrong at all, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I want to fight alongside you again...”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"I barely manage to choke out the words as tears drip down my face.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"I've never felt this embarrassed in all my life, but I've also never wanted anything so much in all my life.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"I want to fight alongside Soujin so badly that I can't help myself.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So do I, Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's why we can't ever leave each other's side.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll stay together and fight together. Forever.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah!”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Soujin drops down on one bent leg right in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"His earnest eyes stare right into mine.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've never been one for words.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So let me stay by your side and convey my feelings with my blade.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you okay with that, Hotori?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Three long years' worth of tears finally surge up within me and spill over at last.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Washing away with them the wretched feelings that had been piling up inside my heart all this time.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please, don't cry.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I never know what to do when you cry.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry... Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Soujin clumsily wipes my cheeks with his fingers, but my tears don't stop.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"The hand caressing my cheek moves to cradle the back of my head.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"The last thing I see as I close my eyes is that awkward, and lame, and terribly lovable smile of his.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"I meet Hotori's tear-stained lips with my own.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mm...”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"We only share the briefest of kisses.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"As I pull away, Hotori vacantly stares at me with unfocused eyes, as though waking from a dream.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There is one thing I still remember from before the war.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You left me with an unfinished task.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"As soon as the Republic's air raids began, I split off from the Myougi Squad.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"I have no recollection why I did that, and everything that happened afterwards is all one hazy fog.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"But I do still remember what Hotori told me as we parted ways.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I love you, Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Please, tell me your answer once the battle is over.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I still haven't given you my answer.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Hotori's eyes go wide.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"I don't know what answer I would have given her back then.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"But I know how I feel now.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't say that what I feel for you is love.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oooh...”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Hotori looks like she's about to cry.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Well, she's been crying for a while now.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But still, you're unbelievably precious to me.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I couldn't ever leave you.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you'll pardon me saying it, you've become an inseparable part of me.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Hotori whispers, an adorably innocent smile on her lips.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I feel the exact same way.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I actually really, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"reeeally",
{"/font"},
" love you, but now that's all flown out the window.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Can... Can I really believe what you said?”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Can you... convince me that it's true?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"We join lips once again.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mmh... mmnnn...”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"It was supposed to be a light kiss, just a brief touch of the lips.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"But neither of us can pull away.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Whenever our lips touch, Hotori's intoxicating fragrance fills up my nostrils.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mmhhh... *smack...* mmn...”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Our kiss grows deeper and deeper as we insatiably devour each other's mouths.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Whenever the tips of our tongues brush against each other, a sweet stimulation races through my body.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haaah...! Ahhh...”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"As our lips finally part, Hotori peers into my eyes with a bewildered expression.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm a little scared.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It feels like I'll die if I'm ever separated from you.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Are you... okay with that?”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You don't even have to ask.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Hotori flutters her eyes shut once again.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Her long, tear-stained eyelashes are irresistibly beautiful.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I won't ever let you go.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"I seal her lips with another kiss.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
